                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="a_hl_legend" parent="helm_layer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Helm release — thứ tự luồng&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;①&lt;/b&gt; push config: App config (kind: HelmRelease) → CI/CD, commit vào Git (Flux)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;②&lt;/b&gt; CI/CD apply → API Server (HTTPS)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;③&lt;/b&gt; API Server lưu HelmRelease (CRD) + Deployment/Service/ConfigMap vào etcd&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;④&lt;/b&gt; Kube-Controller Manager reconcile → tạo Pod &lt;b&gt;object&lt;/b&gt; (ghi vào API Server)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;⑤&lt;/b&gt; kube-scheduler bind Pod ↔ node (qua API Server)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;⑥&lt;/b&gt; kubelet watch API Server → nhận Pod đã bind (trigger)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;⑦&lt;/b&gt; kubelet chạy Pod thật trên Worker Node&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;actor = Flux Pod · state = etcd · kết quả = objects → Pod&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
